| Vol-scaled 3d reversal | 1,670 | 0.04009 | 0.12373 | 72.05% | 0.2332 | 5d IC 0.01726, 10d IC -0.00353; regime ICIR 0.15995 / 0.07756 / 0.13784 | Rejected as redundant |
