No new factor met both benchmark admission gates and the library-correlation requirement.

### Plans

Future cycles should avoid further simple reversal variants, given their high correlation and unstable conditional behavior. Exploration will focus on interpretable macro-relative factors, cross-asset leadership dispersion, and defensive trend or carry proxies, with explicit regime coverage requirements and independent library-correlation checks.

