🚀 Agent run completed. Output: ## Research Cycle Summary — miner_2, 2026-07-16

### Explored Factors

Tested a continuous volatility-term-structure defensive signal:

\[
\text{Factor}_{w}=-\frac{\text{RealizedVol}_{5d}}{\text{RealizedVol}_{w}}
\]

where \(w\) was tested at 20 and 60 trading days. Higher values represent relatively compressed short-term volatility and were intended to identify defensive assets.

The validation used forward-filled, aligned price histories across the 15 tradable benchmark instruments and evaluated multiple forward-return horizons.

### Validation Results

| Variant | Horizon | Observations | Mean names/date | IC | ICIR | Hit ratio | Turnover | Coverage |
|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| −RV5/RV20 | 1d | 2,362 | 15.0 | 0.00418 | 0.01343 | 49.92% | 0.15393 | 99.11% |
| −RV5/RV20 | 5d | 2,358 | 15.0 | 0.00430 | 0.01411 | 49.11% | — | — |
| −RV5/RV20 | 10d | 2,353 | 15.0 | 0.01263 | 0.04188 | 50.87% | — | — |
| −RV5/RV60 | 1d | 2,322 | 15.0 | 0.00593 | 0.01905 | 50.13% | 0.14087 | 97.44% |
| −RV5/RV60 | 5d | 2,318 | 15.0 | 0.00400 | 0.01293 | 49.87% | — | — |
| −RV5/RV60 | 10d | 2,313 | 15.0 | 0.01381 | 0.04541 | 51.92% | — | — |

Validation dates covered 2,388 aligned dates and all 15 instruments, with the effective sample beginning after the required volatility lookback.

The mandatory daily admission gates are absolute IC ≥ 0.0070 and absolute ICIR ≥ 0.0840. Neither variant passed:

- RV20 daily: IC 0.00418, ICIR 0.01343
- RV60 daily: IC 0.00593, ICIR 0.01905

Regime results also lacked sufficient consistency. For the RV20 version, regime IC was negative during 2020–2022 and 2023–2024, becoming positive only in 2025–2026. RV60 showed the same directional improvement in the latest regime but remained weak overall. The 10-day IC improvement did not compensate for failure of the required daily gates.

### Persistence Actions

- No factor persisted.
- No library-correlation admission test was required because both candidates failed the primary validation gates.
- `factor_ensemble.json` was not modified.
- No holdings, allocations, or warm-up state were changed.
- The account remains frozen with no live holdings during the research phase.

### Current Effective Factors

Per the existing library and ensemble, the current effective factors remain:

- `peer_median_leadlag_5d`
- `short_term_reversal_5d`
- `risk_adjusted_momentum_20d`

No new factor was added in this cycle.

### Plans

Future exploration should continue emphasizing orthogonal defensive and cross-asset signals while avoiding additional raw momentum or volatility-ratio variants. Promising candidates should first demonstrate the required daily IC and ICIR across multiple regimes before library-correlation analysis and persistence.

